<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Hand-authored chrome strings for the Android UI (English source). Shared
  `core.*` strings that originate in bae-core live in the generated
  core_strings.xml (loc-gen); these are the app's own labels, buttons, and
  accessibility descriptions. Proper nouns (the "bae" wordmark), log lines, and
  identifiers stay as literals in code and are not listed here.

  The 13 non-English shipping locales declare support via the generated
  values-<locale>/core_strings.xml directories; these chrome strings are not yet
  translated, so a non-English locale falls back to this English source until a
  translation is added.
-->
